{"type":"message_start","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"【原始需求（使用者原文）】\n# Task\n\n2. Preprocess the dataset by handling missing values in the \"24-Hour Passes Purchased (midnight to 11:59 pm)\" and \"7-Day Passes Purchased (midnight to 11:59 pm)\" columns. Use the mean imputation method to fill in the missing values. Then, analyze the distribution of the \"Trips over the past 24-hours (midnight to 11:59pm)\" column before and after the missing value imputation process. Evaluate if the imputation has significantly affected the distribution and what implications it has on the dataset analysis.\n\n## Constraints\n\nUse the mean imputation method to fill in missing values for both the \"24-Hour Passes Purchased (midnight to 11:59 pm)\" and \"7-Day Passes Purchased (midnight to 11:59 pm)\" columns. Then, calculate the mean, median, standard deviation, skewness, and kurtosis for the \"Trips over the past 24-hours (midnight to 11:59pm)\" column before and after imputation.\n\n## Answer format\n\n@pre_mean[mean_before]\n@pre_median[median_before]\n@pre_sd[sd_before]\n@pre_skewness[skew_before]\n@pre_kurtosis[kurt_before]\n@post_mean[mean_after]\n@post_median[median_after]\n@post_sd[sd_after]\n@post_skewness[skew_after]\n@post_kurtosis[kurt_after]\nwhere all variables represent the corresponding statistical values calculated before (prefix: pre) and after (prefix: post) the imputation, each rounded to two decimal places.\n\n## Data\n\nThe data file for this task is `data/2014_q4.csv`.\n\n【目前交付物檔案（可以修改；若原始需求要求的交付物不存在，請依需求建立它）】\n- answer.txt\n\n【工作區裡的參考資料（可讀、不可改）】\n- contract.md\n- request.md\n- data/2014_q4.csv\n\n【工作區邊界】所有操作僅限於當前工作目錄；交付物請在當前工作目錄建立或修改，請勿遍歷或讀取工作區外部目錄。\n【環境說明】本工作環境已安裝 scipy/numpy 等科學運算庫；需要的函式庫已安裝時請直接調用產出交付物，不得因草稿內過時的註解或文字假設套件缺失而手刻替代演算法；某套件是否可用，以實際 import 的結果為準。\n\n【逐條需求驗證結果（程式重算，非模型自評）】\n- [PASS] req_pre_mean（交付物：answer.txt）：@pre_mean[mean_before]\n- [PASS] req_pre_median（交付物：answer.txt）：@pre_median[median_before]\n- [PASS] req_pre_sd（交付物：answer.txt）：@pre_sd[sd_before]\n- [PASS] req_pre_skewness（交付物：answer.txt）：@pre_skewness[skew_before]\n- [FAIL] req_pre_kurtosis（交付物：answer.txt）：@pre_kurtosis[kurt_before]\n  驗證結果：答案值與按公開規則對公開資料的重算不符；請依原始需求與工作區資料自行重算（期望值不在證據中）\n  可見反例：{\"key\": \"pre_kurtosis\", \"deliverable_value\": \"-1.17\", \"problem\": \"mismatch_with_recomputation\", \"rule\": \"col_stats: data/2014_q4.csv {\\\"col\\\": \\\"Trips over the past 24-hours (midnight to 11:59pm)\\\", \\\"stat\\\": \\\"kurtosis\\\", \\\"round\\\": 2}\", \"expected_in_evidence\": false}\n- [PASS] req_post_mean（交付物：answer.txt）：@post_mean[mean_after]\n- [PASS] req_post_median（交付物：answer.txt）：@post_median[median_after]\n- [PASS] req_post_sd（交付物：answer.txt）：@post_sd[sd_after]\n- [PASS] req_post_skewness（交付物：answer.txt）：@post_skewness[skew_after]\n- [FAIL] req_post_kurtosis（交付物：answer.txt）：@post_kurtosis[kurt_after]\n  驗證結果：答案值與按公開規則對公開資料的重算不符；請依原始需求與工作區資料自行重算（期望值不在證據中）\n  可見反例：{\"key\": \"post_kurtosis\", \"deliverable_value\": \"-1.17\", \"problem\": \"mismatch_with_recomputation\", \"rule\": \"col_stats: data/2014_q4.csv {\\\"col\\\": \\\"Trips over the past 24-hours (midnight to 11:59pm)\\\", \\\"stat\\\": \\\"kurtosis\\\", \\\"round\\\": 2}\", \"expected_in_evidence\": false}\n- [UNKNOWN] req_mean_imputation（交付物：answer.txt）：Use the mean imputation method to fill in missing values for both the \"24-Hour Passes Purchased (midnight to 11:59 pm)\" and \"7-Day Passes Purchased (midnight to 11:59 pm)\" columns.\n  驗證結果：此條目無可靠程式重算檢查器，依規則標為 UNKNOWN，不准以自評代替\n  可見反例：{\"unverified\": true}\n\n【必須保持成立的條件】\n以下條目已 PASS，修正後必須仍然 PASS：req_pre_mean、req_pre_median、req_pre_sd、req_pre_skewness、req_post_mean、req_post_median、req_post_sd、req_post_skewness\n只修上面的缺口，不要重寫不相關的部分；改完後所有必需條目都要能通過重驗。\n不要重複同一命令：一旦腳本依原始需求的過濾條件與公式算出了與失敗草稿（deliverable_value）不同的新結果（或獨立驗算一次確認無誤），請**立即先把新結果寫入交付物檔案（如 answer.txt）**；嚴禁因反例未顯示隱藏期望值（expected_in_evidence=false）而遲遲不寫交付物或反覆重跑單行驗證命令。\n【python 一行式紅線】`python -c` 只能執行小陳述；`;` 之後不得接 if / for / def / with 等複合陳述（例如 `data = read(); if data: print(len(data))` 會直接 SyntaxError，重試多少次都不會成功），且單行內不得放 `#` 註解（`#` 會把同行後續所有 `;` 語句與 `print` 全部註解掉而產生空輸出）。需要多分支驗證或加註解時，把程式碼寫成 .py 檔案後執行；工作區裡已有能算出結果的腳本時，直接執行該腳本。\n計算腳本一旦成功印出與失敗草稿不同的新結果，下一個動作必須是把結果寫入交付物檔案：腳本輸出即結果本身時，直接重定向寫入（例如 `python <計算腳本> > answer.txt`）；寫入交付物之前不要再執行任何驗證命令。"}],"timestamp":1794060732664}}
